{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a forgotten fox spirit trying to reclaim your place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the domains of other fox spirits to gain essence and challenge them in turn-based battles. Once you\u2019ve gained enough power, set your sights on defeating the Celestial Fox to stand above all fox spirits as the strongest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t be easy, but you can retry as many times as you need. Each attempt teaches you more, gradually revealing a path to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simplified RPG with turn-based battles. You\u2019ll see a map with icons that you can click to \u201cexplore.\u201d When you explore, text will describe what happens and present choices for how to proceed. Most choices help develop your character\u2019s stats, and occasionally they will lead to battles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Swimmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/6a4e5b770c042d27a1c9b8f8b5242ff61d5ab26f.jpg"},{"name":"Dancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/a96349793065fab19e0132ef3c9a2c3827ccf32c.jpg"},{"name":"Gambler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/459c44b14df2ef342b66212c480c4b23cfe7e0d2.jpg"},{"name":"Caretaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/d12d659485e82e4e6c718dca8c01b32d97238fac.jpg"},{"name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/327fcedebcec27b295c42fccf039211b704fd192.jpg"},{"name":"Enchanter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/09906830bb63187bf62cd8f55f0f73838a6576ae.jpg"},{"name":"Trickster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4088140/2c2ca7